## Confirmation guidance

Fill `report` according to the selected report schema when claiming completion. Questions and stops may include partial reports; a complete report is required only for completion claims. Schema conformance does not prove completion.
For `confirmation-required`, fill `confirmation.text` with the original question, `options`, `recommendation`, `recommendation_reason`, and `evidence` material references. Use empty recommendation and reason strings if unsupported. Human answers are free-form, including questions and conditional answers.
