## Returning the progress block

Write the work result as JSON and submit it with `devkit submit <file>`.
Set `instruction_id` to this work instruction's ID. Use one of these termination kinds: `{{.TerminationCompleted}}` (claim completion), `{{.TerminationQuestion}}` (stop to ask), or `{{.TerminationStopped}}` (report a work stop).
Record the work performed, confirmed items, unconfirmed items, obstacles, and resume conditions in the corresponding fields. For temporary state, record its content, verification method, source, and conditions that invalidate it.
Record unreadable inputs and their effects as unconfirmed items. Add out-of-scope work and reasons for changes as needed.
devkit confirms completion and runs git commit.

